flowchart LR
  EMAIL[Shared AP mailbox] --> GRAPH[Microsoft Graph adapter]
  UPLOAD[Direct API upload] --> INGEST[Ingestion and source hashing]
  GRAPH --> INGEST
  INGEST --> DOCLING[Docling conversion and extraction]
  DOCLING --> AGENT[LangGraph workflow]
  POLICY[(Policies in PostgreSQL plus pgvector)] --> LLAMA[LlamaIndex retrieval]
  OLLAMA[Ollama local LLM] --> AGENT
  LLAMA --> AGENT
  AGENT --> MATCH[Deterministic two-way or three-way matcher]
  ERP[(ERP adapter: PO, GR, open AR)] --> MATCH
  MATCH -->|clean| POST[Idempotent journal or cash application]
  MATCH -->|exception| HUMAN[Human review]
  HUMAN -->|approved| POST
  POST --> ERP
  INGEST --> AUDIT[(Hash-chained audit ledger)]
  AGENT --> AUDIT
  MATCH --> AUDIT
  HUMAN --> AUDIT
  POST --> AUDIT
  AGENT -. traces .-> PHOENIX[Arize Phoenix]

